!! 装饰器模式在咏唱中的作用

装饰器给咏唱流程附加能力。魔法书、法杖、技术法术遗物作为装饰器包裹performer，不改主流程，只追加签名。

!! 核心接口

```ts
export interface ChantPerformer {
  perform(input: ChantPerformInput): Promise<ChantPerformOutput>;
}
```

!! 基础实现

```ts
export class BasicChantPerformer implements ChantPerformer {
  constructor(
    private bus: ChantCommandBus,
    private pipelineFactory: PipelineFactory,
  ) {}

  async perform(input: ChantPerformInput): Promise<ChantPerformOutput> {
    const piped = await this.pipelineFactory
      .create(input.route)
      .run(input.material);

    return {
      output: piped.output,
      trace: piped.trace,
    };
  }
}
```

!! 法杖增幅装饰器

```ts
export class WandAmplifier implements ChantPerformer {
  constructor(
    private inner: ChantPerformer,
    private wand: EquippedWand,
  ) {}

  async perform(input: ChantPerformInput): Promise<ChantPerformOutput> {
    const output = await this.inner.perform(input);

    if (!this.wand.matches(input.params.preferredSource)) {
      return output;
    }

    const amplified = await input.context.codex.artifact.attune({
      artifactId: this.wand.id,
      boundVerse: output.output,
      slot: 'wand:range',
    });

    return {
      ...output,
      output: amplified.boundVerse,
      artifactTrace: [
        ...output.artifactTrace,
        {
          artifactId: this.wand.id,
          slot: 'wand:range',
          sealId: amplified.id,
        },
      ],
    };
  }
}
```

!! 魔法书计量装饰器

```ts
export class SpellbookMeterDecorator implements ChantPerformer {
  constructor(
    private inner: ChantPerformer,
    private spellbook: EquippedSpellbook,
  ) {}

  async perform(input: ChantPerformInput): Promise<ChantPerformOutput> {
    const output = await this.inner.perform(input);

    const meter = await input.context.codex.artifact.readMeter({
      artifactId: this.spellbook.id,
      boundVerse: output.output,
    });

    return {
      ...output,
      output: meter.boundVerse,
      artifactTrace: [
        ...output.artifactTrace,
        {
          artifactId: this.spellbook.id,
          slot: 'spellbook:meter',
          sealId: meter.id,
        },
      ],
    };
  }
}
```

!! 技术法术遗物稳定器

```ts
export class RelicStabilityDecorator implements ChantPerformer {
  constructor(
    private inner: ChantPerformer,
    private relic: TechRelic,
  ) {}

  async perform(input: ChantPerformInput): Promise<ChantPerformOutput> {
    const output = await this.inner.perform(input);

    if (input.context.clock.currentTick() > this.relic.stabilityWindow) {
      return output;
    }

    const stabilized = await input.context.codex.artifact.stabilize({
      artifactId: this.relic.id,
      boundVerse: output.output,
      slot: 'relic:stability',
    });

    return {
      ...output,
      output: stabilized.boundVerse,
      artifactTrace: [
        ...output.artifactTrace,
        {
          artifactId: this.relic.id,
          slot: 'relic:stability',
          sealId: stabilized.id,
        },
      ],
    };
  }
}
```

!! 多重装饰器组合

```ts
let performer: ChantPerformer = new BasicChantPerformer(bus, pipelineFactory);

for (const artifact of context.equipment) {
  if (artifact.type === 'wand') {
    performer = new WandAmplifier(performer, artifact);
  } else if (artifact.type === 'spellbook') {
    performer = new SpellbookMeterDecorator(performer, artifact);
  } else if (artifact.type === 'relic') {
    performer = new RelicStabilityDecorator(performer, artifact);
  }
}

performer = new LoggedChantDecorator(performer, context.logger);
```

