```ts
export interface DecoratorSignature extends ChantSignature {
  kind: 'decorator';
  evidence: {
    decoratorSlot: string;
    artifactId?: string;
  };
}
```

!! 与技能触发的关系

装饰器水印是配方匹配的关键。闪现增强配方可能要求：

```ts
{
  id: 'shorterPreparation',
  sequence: ['observer', 'pipeline', 'decorator'],
  constraints: {
    distinctDecoratorSlots: true,
  },
}
```

需要来自不同槽位的装饰器签名。

